        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add CSS `url()` modifiers]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29440</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/29440"/>
        <updated>2026-04-09T16:21:25.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64103?u=428d3c27c9cd7efc648e17dfe5a4321c3f8e44d2&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Adds the first two supported CSS <code class="notranslate">url(… &lt;modifier&gt;)</code> modifiers, to limit how subresources are loaded.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Spec: <a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#request-url-modifiers" rel="nofollow">Request URL Modifiers</a></li>
<li><a href="https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-26_2-release-notes#:~:text=Added%20support%20for%20cross%2Dorigin%28%29%20and%20referrer%2Dpolicy%28%29%20CSS%20URL%20modifiers%2E%20%28155625162" rel="nofollow">Safari 26.2 Release Notes</a></li>
<li>WPT: <a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-values/urls?label=master&amp;label=experimental&amp;aligned&amp;q=css%2Fcss-values%2Furls%2Furl-request-modifiers" rel="nofollow">https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-values/urls?label=master&amp;label=experimental&amp;aligned&amp;q=css%2Fcss-values%2Furls%2Furl-request-modifiers</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">No implementer has shipped <code class="notranslate">integrity()</code> yet, though I expect Chrome to do so. I can add that feature too, with <code class="notranslate">impl_url</code>, if desired.</p>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4214051830" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3930" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3930/hovercard" href="https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3930">web-platform-dx/web-features#3930</a></li>
<li><a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5111997147512832" rel="nofollow">CSS URL request modifiers - Chrome Platform Status</a></li>
<li><a href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues/435625756" rel="nofollow">Chromium bug 435625756</a></li>
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4224724465" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1386" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1386/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1386">mozilla/standards-positions#1386</a></li>
</ul>

]]></content>
